        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Measurement of the physical form or structure of the liver, the large abdominal organ/gland which functions in the storage and filtration of blood, secretion of bile, detoxification of noxious substances, synthesis and storage of glycogen, synthesis and breakdown of fats and temporary storage of fatty acids, and synthesis of serum proteins.</obo:IAO_0000115>
