        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The amount of albumin in a specified volume of urine.  Urine albumin levels which are above normal but not detectable with routine protein testing are referred to as microalbuminuria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
