        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The time from start to finish of the R wave, the initial upward deflection of the QRS complex following the Q wave which represents early depolarization of the ventricles as illustrated in and electrocardiograph.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">clinical_measurement_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
