        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Quantitation of the catalytic effect exerted by alkaline phosphatase (AP) in a specified sample of blood. AP is an enzyme that catalyzes the cleavage of orthophosphate from orthophosphoric monoesters under alkaline conditions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
