        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This is a measure of the relaxation caused by the addition of some agent or process to a pre-constricted blood vessel. It is the ratio of the amount of dilation generated compared to a fully dilated blood vessel.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">blood vessel dilation expressed as percent relaxation of the force generated in a pre-constricted blood vessel</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
