        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A calculated measurement in which the level of superoxide dismutase enzyme activity in a specified sample of kidney is divided by the weight of total protein in that sample. superoxide dismutases constitute a family of proteins that convert naturally-occuring but harmful superoxide radicals to molecular oxygen and hydrogen peroxide.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CMO:0002229</oboInOwl:id>
