        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A calculated measurement in which the level of paraoxonase 1 enzyme activity in a specified sample of kidney is divided by the weight of total protein in that sample. Paraoxonase 1 is an arylesterase that mainly hydrolyzes paroxon, an organophosphorus anticholinesterase compound, to produce p-nitrophenol.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CMO:0002230</oboInOwl:id>
