        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The length of a straight line passing through a cardiac muscle fiber, that is a cardiomyocyte, for instance through the center of its nucleus, and connecting opposite points on its periphery.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">VT:0000061</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
