        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A measurement which has been normalized, adjusted or derived by a mathematical process or computation, of components of the periodic tightening and loosening of the muscles of a ventricle of the heart.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CMO:0002911</oboInOwl:id>
