        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An injury score obtained by multiplying the degree of glomerular damage (0 to 4) with the percentage of the glomeruli with that type of injury (i.e., increase in mesangial matrix material or glomerulosclerosis).</obo:IAO_0000115>
