        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Measurement of the total weight or heaviness of the copper, an essential dietary trace element, atomic number 29, involved in the formation of bone and blood as a necessary component of several enzymes, in one or both kidneys.</obo:IAO_0000115>
