        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The amount of hyaluronic acid, a mucopolysaccharide composed of N-acetylglucosamine and glucuronic acid subunits found in the connective tissues of vertebrates, found in a specified sample of kidney papillary tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
