        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A measurement of the amount of plasma that perfuses the renal tubules per unit time, derived by measurement of the clearance rate of the non-metabolizable solute para-aminohippurate (PAH).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CMO:0003684</oboInOwl:id>
